#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "B<setup> is called once from within I<linux/init/main.c>.  It calls "
#| "initialization functions for devices and file systems configured into the "
#| "kernel and then mounts the root file system."
msgid ""
"B<setup>()  is called once from within I<linux/init/main.c>.  It calls "
"initialization functions for devices and filesystems configured into the "
"kernel and then mounts the root filesystem."
msgstr ""
"B<setup> é chamada uma vez de I<linux/init/main.c>. Ela chama funções de "
"inicialização para dispositivos e sistemas de arquivos configurados no "
"kernel e então monta o sistema de arquivos raiz."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "No user process may call B<setup>.  Any user process, even a process with "
#| "super-user permission, will receive B<EPERM>."
msgid ""
"No user process may call B<setup>().  Any user process, even a process with "
"superuser permission, will receive B<EPERM>."
msgstr ""
"Nenhum processo de usuário pode chamar B<setup>. Qualquer processo de "
"usuário, mesmo que com permissão de superusuário, receberá B<EPERM>."

